#: app/root.tsx:804
msgid "<0>This the website for the <1><2/> @cons.fyi</1> service. For the full experience, please log in. You’ll be able to:</0><3><4>Tell people which cons you’re going to (you can also do this by liking the con post on Bluesky).</4><5>See who you follow is going to a con.</5></3><6><7>Note:</7> If you’re using a self-hosted PDS, you’ll need to use the dropdown next to the Log in button to specify it.</6>"
